    "updated_at": "2020-04-14T12:50:00Z",
    "body": "Before I do anything I try to make sure I understand how to get the information I need.\r\n\r\nIt seems that running `svn info` reveals the information I want:\r\n\r\n```\r\nWorking Copy Root Path: /data/tmp/svntest1\r\n...\r\nRevision: 3\r\n```\r\nwhere the last part of the `Working Copy Root Path` seems to be the branch.\r\n\r\nThen the output could show branch and revision.",
