    "created_at": "2020-04-14T16:47:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-04-14T16:47:14Z",
    "body": "I thought it is easy enough to regex the two fields in the `svn info` output. But of course, it could also be done via xml. \r\n\r\nI think it is good to have two configurations to implement. First, an `Svn Branch` and then later perhaps an `Svn Status` (like there is for Git). ",
